    {
      "source": "This returns the default options for the XDELEX and XACKDEL commands\nwith <a href=\"RedisStreamCommands.StreamDeletionPolicy.html#KEEP_REFERENCES\"><code>RedisStreamCommands.StreamDeletionPolicy.KEEP_REFERENCES</code></a> as the deletion policy, which preserves\nexisting references in consumer groups' PELs (similar to the behavior of XDEL).",
      "translation": "此方法返回 XDELEX 和 XACKDEL 命令的默认选项，其删除策略为 <a href=\"RedisStreamCommands.StreamDeletionPolicy.html#KEEP_REFERENCES\"><code>RedisStreamCommands.StreamDeletionPolicy.KEEP_REFERENCES</code></a>，该策略会保留消费者组 PEL（待处理消息列表）中现有的引用（其行为类似于 XDEL 命令）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Additional options applicable for XDELEX and XACKDEL commands.",
      "translation": "适用于 XDELEX 和 XACKDEL 命令的附加选项。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "a default <a href=\"RedisStreamCommands.XDelOptions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisStreamCommands.XDelOptions</code></a> instance with <a href=\"RedisStreamCommands.StreamDeletionPolicy.html#KEEP_REFERENCES\"><code>RedisStreamCommands.StreamDeletionPolicy.KEEP_REFERENCES</code></a>.",
      "translation": "默认情况下，使用带有<a href=\"RedisStreamCommands.XDelOptions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisStreamCommands.XDelOptions</code></a>的<a href=\"RedisStreamCommands.StreamDeletionPolicy.html#KEEP_REFERENCES\"><code>RedisStreamCommands.StreamDeletionPolicy.KEEP_REFERENCES</code></a>实例。",
      "count": 1
